      "scene": "Sundqvist has the shift's capture log in kilograms of carbon dioxide and a schedule written in kilograms of methane. Five cards sit on the intake board. Her one warning is that the coefficients painted on the reactor wall compare particles.",
      "takeaway": "Coefficients join moles, so a mass has to be converted before and after they are used.",
